  "prefLabel": "Ncr 213.01 Conclusion of Hearing",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ncr 213.01 Conclusion of Hearing. No party shall be required to rest their case at a particular time, except when the presiding officer is reasonably certain that all relevant evidence, cross-examination, and rebuttal have been heard.\n\nSource. #14254, INTERIM, eff 5-23-25; ss by #14447, eff 12-4-25",
